* Marker symbol cycle.
symbol p1   circle
symbol p2   circle
symbol p3   circle
symbol p4   circle
symbol p5   circle
symbol p6   circle
symbol p7   circle
symbol p8   circle
symbol p9   circle
symbol p10  circle
symbol p11  circle
symbol p12  circle
symbol p13  circle
symbol p14  circle
